w great  marvel studios is at capturing the  audience's attention for example ever  since the release of marvel's television  shows wandavision and loki on disney  plus the buzz about a multiverse has not  died down for a second  this buzz was only heightened when it  was confirmed that characters from other  universes would be appearing in no way  home  now that the audience is able to  understand how impactful no way home  could be to the mcu i think it's likely  that it will be almost as successful as  avengers end game if not even more so  simply because of the enormous amount of  hype and buzz surrounding this movie  and ultimately that's what any studio  should do for their upcoming large  budget films create hype for the project  as well as an environment where buzz is  likely to occur  months before it's set to release and  then slowly let out more information in  order to stay top of mind and to create  additional buzz  marvel studios has been at this for over  a decade and they have seemingly  perfected the art of capturing their  audience's attention  now we just have to wait and see if  spider-man no way home lives up to the  hype on december 17th  well that's gonna be everything from us  today on spiderman no way home if you  enjoyed the video please hit the like  button and don't forget to subscribe for  more great content what are your  spiderman theories was the andrew  garfield video faked we'd like to know  your thoughts so drop them in the  comment section below  from everyone here at stream in the  galaxy we hope you have a great day and  thanks for watching  [Music]
 

